WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:09.710
Open someone's day: their clocking and breaks, where they were, and everything they did, then follow the whole team's activity.

2
00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:14.990
From the live board, open the person you want to look at.

3
00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:18.200
Choose their name.

4
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:23.800
At the top: their last activity, and how long ago it was.

5
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:30.770
Today's figures: the shift, first in, last out, time worked against the schedule, breaks and overtime.

6
00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:39.220
The day, hour by hour: the shift, clocked time and breaks, inside or outside the circle, and every recorded action.

7
00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:46.130
Point at any bar or dot with the mouse to see exactly what happened and when.

8
00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:54.580
Each clocking with its distance, precision and verdict. HR can add one or cancel a wrong one, with a note.

9
00:00:54.580 --> 00:01:01.120
Everything they did, newest first. Filter it by date and source, and choose the order.

10
00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:08.970
The month at a glance: each day coloured by how it went. Choose a day to open it.

11
00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:13.640
Activity shows everything the whole team did, as it happens.

12
00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:19.880
Narrow it to one person, a department, a source or a range of dates.
